                                "sense_id": "e3399b62-33c1-3d51-accd-9046fe354ab0",
                                "text": "For example, the IIS 3.0 denial-of-service attacks that brought down Microsoft's web site several times in 1997 quickly led to the release of a hotfix."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
